<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#405779; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font color="#ffffff" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi Team,</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial">The Scheduled batch &nbsp;{!espy__Batch_Monitoring__c.Name} has been deleted.&nbsp;</font><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Kindly look into the issue.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial">To Reschedule the scheduler , Kindly follow the below steps :</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial">1. Login to Salesforce</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">2. Go to Developer Console , Open </span>Asynchronous<span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;window</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">3. Execute the below command.</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></font><font color="#ffffff" face="arial">system.schedule({</font><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">!Batch_Monitoring__c.Name}</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial;">,</span><font color="#ffffff" face="arial">{!espy__Batch_Monitoring__c.espy__CronExpression__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial;">,new {</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">!Batch_Monitoring__c.Name}</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial;">());</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial">Regards</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff" face="arial">Support &nbsp;Team.</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>